        Compress PDF <br/>
        <span style="color: var(--color-lime);">to 100KB.</span>
      </h1>
      <p style="color: var(--color-ink-2); font-size: 1.125rem; margin-bottom: 24px; max-width: 500px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; line-height: 1.6;">
        Instantly compress your PDF document to exactly 100KB for portal uploads. Processed 100% securely on your device.
